  {
   "title": "Tagalog and Spanish numbers",
   "blocks": [
    {
     "type": "p",
     "t": "Filipinos use **two sets of numbers**: the Tagalog ones and Spanish ones (spelled the Tagalog way). The Spanish numbers are still common, **especially among older people** and **in buying and selling**, so it is useful to learn both. This lesson gives the Spanish number wherever Filipinos commonly use it."
