   "title": "Fractions",
   "blocks": [
    {
     "type": "p",
     "t": "One part of a whole is made by adding the prefix **ka-** (a shortened **ika-**) to the **lower number** of the fraction. The word **bahagi** (*part*) is often added too, for clarity. **Kalahatì** (half) is a set name of its own."
